loom witness=standing_equipment wall_s=7 scan_runs_red=0 scan_runs_self_red=1
loom cold_pass=standing_equipment_run guards=135 green=130 red=1 gated=4 wall_s=866 tree_moved=no
file construction/standing-equipment.kyri one row -- conflict_marker, tier lap, 0.3s
file tools/fixtures/c/conflict_marker_scan.sh every tracked file read for a labelled marker, one git grep, pathspec exclusions
file tools/fixtures/c/conflict_marker_control.sh 23 readings over 10 planted states in 9 real repositories, a real merge conflict among them
file tools/c/conflict_marker_witness.rish the guard the card's own damage went three commits without
file construction/CHECKPOINTS.md the cairn before src/gate/README.md molted its register in place
file src/gate/README.md register molted C+/79 to B/83, every claim held exactly
file construction/REDS.md %481 booked and closed on the marker guard; my %464 close withdrawn, a peer's standing
file construction/archive/REDS-a-proof-nobody-runs-rows-482.md the one surviving recovered row, renumbered five times off the fetched spine
file session-logs/date/20260906/20260906-013801_the-census-of-what-no-compiler-reads.kyri a record restored byte-for-byte from stash@{1}; its code was superseded by %463
file construction/ITINERARY.md my own block replaced and condensed to the bound; a peer's paragraph restored after I touched it
recommend check-in (Keaton) -- one door and one question. The door: both stashes in this tree now hold only records the tree carries, so they are safe for a hand to drop, and dropping them is yours. The question is the one %482 leaves standing and this lap met from a second direction -- the QA card's Truth reading counts whether a cited path RESOLVES, so a page can carry a perfect Truth over proofs nothing runs, and widening it touches every lane. And a third thing worth your eye rather than a lap: two of my three findings were landed independently by peers within four hours, from the same booked remainder, and the instrument for exactly that waste was one of the two. Nothing in the ledger shows a red is BEING WORKED, which is your own standing question about whether an OPEN row should carry a seat and a stamp at start. This round is the strongest evidence for it yet. The identity gap in the weave still waits on your word.
